speechtext:
Under this heading the
total imports in 1936 were valued at $364,000, of which $357,000 came from Great Britain. Our exports are not separately listed in the trade returns. Our production in 1935 is a combination of a number of items, of which the following will give an idea: $2,000,000; $1,000,000;	$59S,000;	8215,000;	$98,000;
$615,000; $69,000 and $86,000. That is the total of our own production.
